message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Donghyunq (동현큐): a single-player line-claiming laboratory in the manner of Qix, with the mode, starting level and lives set through the esoteric language Donghyun-lang"
type: software
version: "0.04"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24084894"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
